 "label": "SIMULATED",
 "what": "digital-twin analysis, held-out monsoons Jun-Sep 2024+2025, 4 sites summed; real forcing (ERA5 rain, archived JMA day-ahead forecast, harmonic tide), ASSUMPTION process parameters",
